== Notes ==

*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*Instead of a single ball doing up to 15d6 damage, this spell actually creates up to 15 balls that can strike different targets, each doing 1d6 damage.
** This makes ''ball lightning'' rather ineffective against creatures with any amount of electrical [[damage resistance]].
** The target selection of this spell is that of the [[Isaac's lesser missile storm|missile storms]] (except this spell cannot target a location). The lightning balls will be distributed evenly among the potential targets in a gargantuan area, with any excess balls directed at the first target.

=== Previous versions ===
*Prior to version 1.69, the saving throw was made against fire instead of electricity.
*Prior to version 1.65, there was no saving throw.

